{
 "encounter_id": "00576",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CLINICAL_STAFF"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hi, sorry I'm late. The parking garage was full, so I circled twice."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That garage is a nightmare, and this rain didn't help."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I love the rain, it's the humidity that gets me. Anyway, such a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Hi again, Maria. I'll get your vitals before the doctor starts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sure. My daughter's recital is tonight, so I'm kind of distracted."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Arm out for me. Doctor, numbers are on the screen.",
   "pause": 6
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks, Jess. Maria, how's the lichen planus been?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Up and down. The rash on my wrists came back about four months ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it itchy, painful, or both?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Itchy, mostly. I scratch at night and wake up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So the itching at night is waking you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, most nights. Oh, and my mouth too. These sore patches inside my cheeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tell me about the mouth. When did that start?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Maybe two months back? They sting when I eat spicy food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any trouble swallowing, or feeling like food is catching?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, swallowing's fine. Everything goes down okay."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever or feeling feverish recently?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever. Just a scratchy throat last week, probably my son's cold."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. Any hair falling out, or changes in your nails?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, hair's the same. Nails are fine too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What about joint pain or stiffness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nope, my joints are good."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's go over your medications. What are you taking right now?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay, so there's the levothyroxine, 50 micrograms in the morning. And the omeprazole, 20 mg before breakfast."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. And for the itching?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The hydroxyzine, 25 mg at bedtime, for the itch. It makes me groggy, but it helps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any creams at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I ran out of the steroid cream last month. Is that bad?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No, we'll talk about it. Let me ask about allergies first. Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, sulfa drugs. I got hives from a sulfa antibiotic years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll flag that. Any other medical history besides the lichen planus?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The thyroid, obviously, my underactive thyroid for about ten years. And acid reflux. And I get migraines now and then."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. How long have you had the lichen planus?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two years. I was diagnosed after the mouth thing first showed up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any surgeries?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just my tonsils out as a kid. I was eight, I think."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Family history? Anything like autoimmune disease, skin problems, diabetes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mom has diabetes, type 2. And my dad had melanoma."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks. Let me ask about habits. Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I quit smoking about ten years ago. I was never a heavy smoker anyway."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I drink maybe two glasses of wine a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I teach fifth grade. And I live with my husband and the two kids."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Busy household. Now, any chest symptoms, cough or trouble with your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my breathing's totally fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Let me examine you. Wrists first, then mouth, scalp and nails.",
   "pause": 8
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "On both wrists there are flat-topped, purple bumps with fine white lines. Inside both cheeks I see a white lacy pattern.",
   "pause": 4
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that bad? It looks worse than I thought."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's consistent with what we expect. Your scalp has no scarring or bald patches, and your nails look normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me read your numbers. Blood pressure is 126 over 80, and pulse is 74."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Temperature is 36.8 degrees, and oxygen saturation is 99 percent. Weight is 71 kilograms."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that okay?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All reasonable. This looks like an active flare of lichen planus."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So it's not something new? Not something worse?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It doesn't look like it. But a closer look is sensible."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Meaning what? You're going to cut me?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A small punch biopsy of the wrist, yes. I'd like to arrange it for next week, under local anesthetic."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ugh. Okay. Will it scar?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A tiny mark, no bigger than a pencil eraser."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd also like to order a hepatitis C blood test. It's linked with lichen planus, and we've never checked."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. That makes me nervous."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Most people test negative. And we'll do a thyroid level too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. Does the steroid cream matter in the meantime?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep using it in thin layers on the wrists. My staff will renew it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can send the refill to your pharmacy today, and the lab slips are ready at the front desk."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Great. And if the rash isn't getting better?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If it's not improving in six weeks, come back and see me and we'll talk about stronger options."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Thanks, I'm off to that recital now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good luck, Maria. Drive safely and enjoy the show."
  }
 ],
